  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)<br><strong>Mods:</strong> All Smartgun Link and Smart Rebuild Attachments</p>\n<p>For Smartgun Links and Smart Rebuilds: while wielding two or more Twin-Linked weapons, fire them all at one target as a Linked Attack, all in the same fire mode and all Explosive or all Non-Explosive. Use the highest DV among them and your lowest Skill among them; each weapon spends its usual ammo. On a hit, roll the biggest damage source and add +1 per d6 the other weapons would have rolled (for Autofire, the biggest source is the highest Autofire rating). Example: a 3d6 pistol linked with a 5d6 rifle at 12m/yds uses the rifle's DV16 and deals 5d6+3.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
